tml>",
  "body": "<!doctype html><html><body style=\"margin:0;background:#f6efe3;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#1c1612\"><div style=\"display:none\">Your seat is open, and the Studi download is ready.</div><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:44px 20px\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"560\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"max-width:100%;background:#fffaf0;border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden\"><tr><td style=\"padding:28px 30px;background:#b9e8ff\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:bold\">A NOTE FROM INKY</div><h1 style=\"margin:8px 0 0;font-size:30px;line-height:36px\">Okay. I’m ready when you are.</h1></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:26px 30px 30px\"><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:25px\">Your private-beta seat is open. I scan your schoolwork, queue what is due, finish assignments on the real school page, and wait for your final say before submitting.</p><p style=\"padding:15px 18px;background:#dff6e8;border-radius:12px;font-size:14px;line-height:22px\"><strong>The beta is free.</strong> No card, trial clock, or surprise charge.</p><p><a href=\"{{action_url}}\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:13px 22px;background:#ffe56a;color:#1c1612;border-radius:999px;text-decoration:none;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold\">Download Studi for Windows or Mac</a></p><p style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#857a72\">This download link expires in {{invitation.expires_in_days}} days.</p><p style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:22px;color:#5f554e\">See you inside.<br>— Inky ✎</p></td></tr></table><p style=\"font-size:12px;color:#857a72\">You got this because you joined Inky’s waitlist.</p></td></tr></table></body></html>"
